            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.51

- The map's header now shows what you're looking at (illness, measure, areas and week) in larger, bolder text.
- The Briefing / Map switch in the sidebar is now a standard-size toggle, and the sidebar has one divider instead of two.
- In Analyst, the legend explains the orange and blue state outlines without being opened: orange means wastewater is rising, blue means it's falling.
]]></description>
